  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A School Vehicle in Rural Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Modern Model Residential School currently provides education and boarding facilities to 32 orphans and children in a remote village in Western Nepal. Furthermore, 125 other children attend school during day time. A newly built basic road has brought so much hope. An affordable used pickup or a new one bought with a 50% down payment would help our school transport food and school items from the city to the village, and help take our children and locals to a hospital during a health emergency.</narrative>
  </description>
